## 🛠 Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

#### "Projects not found"
```bash
# Check permissions
chmod -R 755 /your/projects/directory

# Verify paths in commonPaths array
```

#### "Build failed"
```bash
# Check if build tools are installed
npm list -g
python --version
```

#### "Mobile app not loading"
```bash
# Check if server is running
netstat -an | grep 8080

# Try different port
npx http-server . -p 3000
```

